ecurityPage.tsx:83\" class=\"text-white font-semibold mb-1\">Enterprise-Grade Security</h3><p data-loc=\"client/src/pages/SecurityPage.tsx:84\" class=\"text-slate-400 text-sm\">Multi-layered defense mechanisms protecting your infrastructure 24/7</p></div></div><div data-loc=\"client/src/pages/SecurityPage.tsx:89\" class=\"flex items-start gap-4\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-lock w-6 h-6 text-cyan-400 flex-shrink-0 mt-1\" data-loc=\"client/src/pages/SecurityPage.tsx:90\"><rect width=\"18\" height=\"11\" x=\"3\" y=\"11\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4\"></path></svg><div data-loc=\"client/src/pages/SecurityPage.tsx:91\"><h3 data-loc=\"client/src/pages/SecurityPage.tsx:92\" class=\"text-white font-semibold mb-1\">Data Sovereignty</h3><p data-loc=\"client/src/pages/SecurityPage.tsx:93\" class=\"text-slate-400 text-sm\">Your data remains under your control in your chosen jurisdiction</p></div></div><div data-loc=\"client/src/pages/SecurityPage.tsx:98\" class=\"flex items-start gap-4\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-key w-6 h-6 text-cyan-400 flex-shrink-0 mt-1\" data-loc=\"client/src/pages/SecurityPage.tsx:99\"><path d=\"m15.5 7.5 2.3 2.3a1 1 0 0 0 1.4 0l2.1-2.1a1 1 0 0 0 0-1.4L19 4\"></path><path d=\"m21 2-9.6 9.6\"></path><circle cx=\"7.5\" cy=\"15.5\" r=\"5.5\"></circle></svg><div data-loc=\"client/src/pages/SecurityPage.tsx:100\"><h3 data-loc=\"client/src/pages/SecurityPage.tsx:101\" class=\"text-white font-semibold mb-1\">Access Control</h3><p data-loc=\"client/src/pages/SecurityPage.tsx:102\" class=\"text-slate-400 text-sm\">Granular permissions and role-based a