-relaxed\">Your data stays your data — never retained for training, never shared, never out of your tenant. Complete data isolation and confidentiality.</p></div><div data-loc=\"client/src/pages/SecurityPage.tsx:129\" class=\"group bg-slate-800/50 backdrop-blur border border-slate-700 rounded-xl p-8 hover:border-cyan-400/50 transition-all duration-300 hover:shadow-lg hover:shadow-cyan-500/10\"><div data-loc=\"client/src/pages/SecurityPage.tsx:133\" class=\"flex items-start gap-4 mb-4\"><div data-loc=\"client/src/pages/SecurityPage.tsx:134\" class=\"p-3 bg-cyan-500/10 rounded-lg group-hover:bg-cyan-500/20 transition-colors\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-lock w-6 h-6 text-cyan-400\" data-loc=\"client/src/pages/SecurityPage.tsx:135\"><rect width=\"18\" height=\"11\" x=\"3\" y=\"11\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4\"></path></svg></div></div><h3 data-loc=\"client/src/pages/SecurityPage.tsx:138\" class=\"text-xl font-bold text-white mb-3\">Tenant isolation &amp; data residency</h3><p data-loc=\"client/src/pages/SecurityPage.tsx:139\" class=\"text-slate-400 leading-relaxed\">A dedicated, encrypted environment for your organization, with the option to keep all data in your chosen jurisdiction. Full compliance with data sovereignty requirements.</p></div><div data-loc=\"client/src/pages/SecurityPage.tsx:129\" class=\"group bg-slate-800/50 backdrop-blur border border-slate-700 rounded-xl p-8 hover:border-cyan-400/50 transition-all duration-300 hover:shadow-lg hover:shadow-cyan-500/10\"><div data-loc=\"client/src/pages/SecurityPage.tsx:133\" class=\"flex items-start gap-4 mb-4\"><div data-loc=\"client/src/pages/SecurityPage.tsx:134\" class=\"p-3 bg-cyan-500/10 rounded-lg group-hover:bg-cyan-500/20 transition-colors\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" w